{"slug":"kh-l-q","ar":"خ ل ق","total":261,"core":"creation; character","forms":[{"ar":"خَلَقَ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":184,"gloss":"To create","word":"khalaqa","ex":{"s":55,"a":3,"p":1,"ar":["خَلَقَ","ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ"],"en":"Created man"}},{"ar":"خَلْق","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":52,"gloss":"Creation","word":"al-khalq","ex":{"s":35,"a":16,"p":5,"ar":["إِن","يَشَأْ","يُذْهِبْكُمْ","وَيَأْتِ","بِخَلْقٍ","جَدِيدٍ"],"en":"If He wills, He can do away with you and bring forth a new creation"}},{"ar":"خَٰلِق","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":12,"gloss":"The Creator","word":"al-khaliq","ex":{"s":37,"a":125,"p":5,"ar":["أَتَدْعُونَ","بَعْلًا","وَتَذَرُونَ","أَحْسَنَ","ٱلْخَـٰلِقِينَ"],"en":"Do you call upon Ba'l and leave the best of creators"}},{"ar":"خَلَٰق","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":6,"gloss":"share, portion","word":null,"ex":{"s":2,"a":200,"p":24,"ar":["فَإِذَا","قَضَيْتُم","مَّنَـٰسِكَكُمْ","فَٱذْكُرُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","كَذِكْرِكُمْ","ءَابَآءَكُمْ","أَوْ","أَشَدَّ","ذِكْرًا ۗ","فَمِنَ","ٱلنَّاسِ","مَن","يَقُولُ","رَبَّنَآ","ءَاتِنَا","فِى","ٱلدُّنْيَا","وَمَا","لَهُۥ","فِى","ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","مِنْ","خَلَـٰقٍ"],"en":"And when you have completed your rites, remember Allah like your [previous] remembrance of your fathers or with [much] greater remembrance. And among the people is he who says, \"Our Lord, give us in this world,\" and he will have in the Hereafter no share"}},{"ar":"مُخَلَّقَة","kind":"passive participle","form":2,"count":2,"gloss":"formed, shaped","word":null,"ex":{"s":22,"a":5,"p":22,"ar":["يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلنَّاسُ","إِن","كُنتُمْ","فِى","رَيْبٍ","مِّنَ","ٱلْبَعْثِ","فَإِنَّا","خَلَقْنَـٰكُم","مِّن","تُرَابٍ","ثُمَّ","مِن","نُّطْفَةٍ","ثُمَّ","مِنْ","عَلَقَةٍ","ثُمَّ","مِن","مُّضْغَةٍ","مُّخَلَّقَةٍ","وَغَيْرِ","مُخَلَّقَةٍ","لِّنُبَيِّنَ","لَكُمْ ۚ","وَنُقِرُّ","فِى","ٱلْأَرْحَامِ","مَا","نَشَآءُ","إِلَىٰٓ","أَجَلٍ","مُّسَمًّى","ثُمَّ","نُخْرِجُكُمْ","طِفْلًا","ثُمَّ","لِتَبْلُغُوٓا۟","أَشُدَّكُمْ ۖ","وَمِنكُم","مَّن","يُتَوَفَّىٰ","وَمِنكُم","مَّن","يُرَدُّ","إِلَىٰٓ","أَرْذَلِ","ٱلْعُمُرِ","لِكَيْلَا","يَعْلَمَ","مِنۢ","بَعْدِ","عِلْمٍ","شَيْـًٔا ۚ","وَتَرَى","ٱلْأَرْضَ","هَامِدَةً","فَإِذَآ","أَنزَلْنَا","عَلَيْهَا","ٱلْمَآءَ","ٱهْتَزَّتْ","وَرَبَتْ","وَأَنۢبَتَتْ","مِن","كُلِّ","زَوْجٍۭ","بَهِيجٍ"],"en":"O People, if you should be in doubt about the Resurrection, then [consider that] indeed, We created you from dust, then from a sperm-drop, then from a clinging clot, and then from a lump of flesh, formed and unformed - that We may show you. And We settle in the wombs whom We will for a specified term, then We bring you out as a child, and then [We develop you] that you may reach your [time of] maturity. And among you is he who is taken in [early] death, and among you is he who is returned to the most decrepit [old] age so that he knows, after [once having] knowledge, nothing. And you see the earth barren, but when We send down upon it rain, it quivers and swells and grows [something] of every beautiful kind"}},{"ar":"خَلَّٰق","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"the Supreme Creator","word":null,"ex":{"s":15,"a":86,"p":4,"ar":["إِنَّ","رَبَّكَ","هُوَ","ٱلْخَلَّـٰقُ","ٱلْعَلِيمُ"],"en":"Indeed, your Lord - He is the Knowing Creator"}},{"ar":"خُلُق","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"character; custom","word":null,"ex":{"s":68,"a":4,"p":3,"ar":["وَإِنَّكَ","لَعَلَىٰ","خُلُقٍ","عَظِيمٍ"],"en":"And indeed, you are of a great moral character"}},{"ar":"ٱخْتِلَٰق","kind":"verbal noun","form":8,"count":1,"gloss":"fabrication, invention","word":null,"ex":{"s":38,"a":7,"p":10,"ar":["مَا","سَمِعْنَا","بِهَـٰذَا","فِى","ٱلْمِلَّةِ","ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","إِنْ","هَـٰذَآ","إِلَّا","ٱخْتِلَـٰقٌ"],"en":"We have not heard of this in the latest religion. This is not but a fabrication"}}],"surahs":[[7,11],[16,11],[23,10],[30,10],[36,10],[39,8],[3,7],[6,7],[17,7],[2,6],[10,6],[15,6],[25,6],[37,6],[38,6],[43,6],[13,5],[29,5],[31,5],[35,5],[4,4],[9,4],[18,4],[21,4],[22,4],[26,4],[32,4],[40,